### =========================================================================
### MMDBConnect CMS - HTTP REQUEST COLLECTION (REST CLIENT)
### Blog, Article & Journal Content Management System
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# Simpan token session jika ingin menggunakan Authorization header sebagai alternatif cookie:
@sessionToken = 


### =========================================================================
### 1. AUTENTIKASI ADMINISTRATOR (HTTP-only Cookie Session)
### =========================================================================

### 1.1 Login Administrator
# Response akan otomatis menyetel HTTP-only cookie 'session_id'
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mmdbconnect.com",
  "password": "adminpassword123"
}

### 1.2 Cek Profil Administrator yang Sedang Login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 1.3 Logout Administrator (Menghapus Sesi & Cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 2. ENDPOINT PUBLIK (Hanya Menampilkan Konten Published)
### =========================================================================

### 2.1 Daftar Semua Konten Published (Pagination Default: Page 1, Limit 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts

### 2.2 Filter Berdasarkan Jenis Konten (article / blog / journal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?type=article

### 2.3 Filter Berdasarkan Tag (MySQL JSON_CONTAINS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?tag=Go

### 2.4 Filter Konten Unggulan (Featured)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?featured=true

### 2.5 Pagination Khusus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?page=1&limit=5

### 2.6 Detail Konten Berdasarkan Slug (Render HTML & Increment Views)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/building-rest-apis-with-go

### 2.7 Daftar Semua Kategori Publik
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories

### 2.8 Konten Berdasarkan Slug Kategori
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/tutorials-tech/posts

### 2.9 Format URL Publik Ramah SEO (Direct Pattern Aliases)
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/building-rest-apis-with-go

GET {{baseUrl}}/blog/my-development-journey

GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/rust-vs-go-file-hashing

GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/software-engineering


### =========================================================================
### 3. ADMIN: KELOLA KONTEN (POSTS CRUD)
### =========================================================================

### 3.1 Daftar Semua Konten Admin (Termasuk Draft & Published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 3.2 Filter Konten Admin (Hanya Draft)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts?status=draft
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 3.3 Buat Konten Baru (Default Status: Draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "type": "article",
  "title": "Optimasi Database MySQL untuk Aplikasi Golang",
  "excerpt": "Panduan praktis indexing, connection pooling, dan query execution di MySQL.",
  "content": "# Optimasi Database MySQL\n\nMySQL 8.0 menyediakan berbagai fitur performa tinggi...\n\n- Connection Pooling\n- Indexing yang tepat\n- JSON queries",
  "cover_image": "/uploads/sample-cover.png",
  "category_id": 1,
  "tags": ["Go", "MySQL", "Database", "Performance"],
  "meta_title": "Optimasi MySQL untuk Golang - Best Practices",
  "meta_description": "Pelajari cara mengoptimalkan koneksi dan query database MySQL 8.0 pada backend Go.",
  "is_featured": true,
  "status": "draft"
}

### 3.4 Buat Konten Baru Langsung Dipublikasikan (Status: Published)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "type": "journal",
  "title": "Eksperimen Memori dan Profiling di Go 1.25",
  "content": "# Eksperimen Memori Go\n\nHari ini melakukan profiling memori menggunakan pprof dan tracing...",
  "tags": ["Go", "Profiling", "Memory"],
  "status": "published"
}

### 3.5 Ambil Detail Konten Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 3.6 Perbarui Konten (Ubah Status ke Published / Edit Konten)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "type": "article",
  "title": "Building REST APIs with Go & Chi (Updated)",
  "slug": "building-rest-apis-with-go",
  "excerpt": "Panduan komprehensif membangun RESTful API modern dan cepat dengan Go dan Chi.",
  "content": "# Building REST APIs with Go\n\nVersi revisi dengan penambahan middleware autentikasi cookie session...",
  "category_id": 2,
  "tags": ["Go", "Chi", "REST API", "Backend"],
  "is_featured": true,
  "status": "published"
}

### 3.7 Hapus Konten Berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts/4
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 4. ADMIN: KELOLA KATEGORI (CATEGORIES CRUD)
### =========================================================================

### 4.1 Daftar Kategori Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 4.2 Tambah Kategori Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "name": "Cloud Architecture",
  "slug": "cloud-architecture"
}

### 4.3 Update Kategori Berdasarkan ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "name": "Software Engineering & Architecture",
  "slug": "software-engineering-architecture"
}

### 4.4 Hapus Kategori Berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/4
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 5. ADMIN: UPLOAD GAMBAR COVER (LOCAL FILESYSTEM)
### =========================================================================

### 5.1 Upload File Gambar Cover (Multipart Form Data)
# Catatan: Di REST Client, ganti path file sesuai file gambar lokal di sistem Anda
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="cover.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./cover.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
